# Atroxian Realm (Gridlock, 2016; v1.5) as a Keen Worlds world. Written by
# tools/kw_arealm.py from the game's GPL source; the data files beside it are
# the player's copy of the game. It runs on the engine's Keen 5 code, which
# its own source was written from, so Keen 5's variables are the base.

