%string ck_str_storyText
	"Commander Keen in...\n"
	"Atroxian Realm!\n"
	"\n"
	"Stranded on planet\n"
	"Krisle after answering\n"
	"a distress signal of\n"
	"garbled Omnispeak,\n"
	"Commander Keen stumbles\n"
	"into the center of a\n"
	"war between the\n"
	"planet's native race,\n"
	"the Krile, and a swarm\n"
	"of robotic invaders\n"
	"called Atroxians.\n"
	"\n"
	"To end the exile of the\n"
	"Krile and escape the\n"
	"desolate world, he must\n"
	"brave the darkness of\n"
	"the Atroxian Realm that\n"
	"has engulfed the\n"
	"planet.\n"
	"\n"
	"Deadly swamps, Atroxian\n"
	"strongholds, and\n"
	"malevolent forces\n"
	"await. Only he can\n"
	"restore light to\n"
	"Krisle!\n"

%string ar_str_entryMapFinal "Keen prepares for\nhis final battle"
%string ar_str_entryCrashReturn "Keen returns to the\nBWB Megarocket\ncrash site"

